# CR 305.6's intrinsic land ability plus CR 601.2h payment: tap the Plains
# for white, then spend it paying a {W} cost. Every other mana-payment
# fixture preloads the pool via setup.state's own manapool= -- this is the
# first one where the mana actually comes from a card on the battlefield.
# Main phase of turn 1, so the payment is made at a priority (L2 S19).
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 1 W
paymanacost human W
